// `e.db.docstore`: documents, the event journal, projections and subscriptions over one
// append-only file. The generated region (scripts/gen_db_docstore_test.py) is an independent
// struct+zlib writer of the documented format: the exact bytes ten scripted operations must
// produce, and for every prefix of the log the state a recovery must reach. Sections: the byte
// image and the live state (1xx), optimistic concurrency (2xx), recovery over torn tails and a
// flipped byte (3xx), a projection with catch-up and rebuild (4xx), a subscription resuming
// across a reopen (5xx), compaction and a store round trip (6xx), capacity (7xx). Every check
// has its own exit code.
